IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `snap1-logic`
IMPORT `snap1-s2019`

-- Tests for 7 U.S.C. 2019. Expected values are written from the text before the code was run.

-- the channels: approved wholesale food concern, FDIC-insured institution, credit-union-insured institution
#ASSERT `s 2019 the channel is one through which benefits accepted by retail food stores are redeemed` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the channel is one through which benefits accepted by retail food stores are redeemed` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the channel is one through which benefits accepted by retail food stores are redeemed` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the channel is one through which benefits accepted by retail food stores are redeemed` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first exception (the seam is the answer of section 2012(o)(4))
#ASSERT `s 2019 the retail food store is authorized to redeem the members' food benefits before the members receive the food` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the retail food store is authorized to redeem the members' food benefits before the members receive the food` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the second exception: arguments are authorized for on-line transactions, delivery within a reasonable time
#ASSERT `s 2019 the retail food store is authorized to accept benefits before the delivery of the food` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the retail food store is authorized to accept benefits before the delivery of the food` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the retail food store is authorized to accept benefits before the delivery of the food` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2019 the retail food store is authorized to accept benefits before the delivery of the food` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the four kinds of body, each with and without the point-of-sale devices and the EBT area: arguments are the four kinds, point-of-sale, EBT area
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the body may be authorized to redeem benefits through a financial institution` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the fee
#ASSERT `s 2019 the financial institution may impose on or collect from the retail food store a fee or other charge for the redemption` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2019 the financial institution may impose on or collect from the retail food store a fee or other charge for the redemption` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
